<h1 style="font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #000000; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.025em;"><%= @title %></h1>

<p style="margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 16px; color: #4B5563;">Dear <%= @owner.try(:username) || @owner.try(:email) %>,</p>

<p style="margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.6; color: #1F2937;">
  This is a proactive notification to let you know that your <strong><%= @resource.class.name.titleize %></strong> for Order <strong>#<%= @order.order_number %></strong> is approaching its expiration date.
</p>

<div style="background-color: #FFFBEB; border: 1px solid #FEF3C7; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 32px;">
  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="font-size: 15px; color: #92400E;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: 500;">Status</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; text-align: right; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Expiring Soon</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: 500;">Time Remaining</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; text-align: right; color: #B45309; font-weight: 800; font-size: 18px;">~<%= @hours %> Hours</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: 500;">Expiration Date</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; text-align: right; font-weight: 600;"><%= @resource.expires_at&.strftime('%B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p') %></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<p style="margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4B5563;">
  To ensure uninterrupted service and retain your current configuration (IP addresses, credentials, etc.), we recommend renewing your plan before the expiration time.
</p>

<div style="text-align: center; margin: 40px 0;">
    <a href="<%= ENV['FRONTEND_URL'] %>/dashboard/orders" style="background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff; padding: 16px 32px; border-radius: 12px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; display: inline-block; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);">Renew Subscription Now</a>
</div>

<p style="margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #E5E7EB; font-size: 12px; color: #9CA3AF; text-align: center;">
  If you have already renewed or set up auto-renewal, please ignore this message.<br>
  Thank you for choosing ProxySock.
</p>
